OL,3,GNEWSAPolice shut A1 stretch after
OL,4,Atwo-car collision
OL,5,
OL,6,FPart of the A1 near Peterborough was
OL,7,Fshut after a collision involving two
OL,8,Fcars.
OL,10,FPolice closed the southbound
OL,11,Fcarriageway between Stamford,
OL,12,FLincolnshire, and Wansford in
OL,13,FCambridgeshire on Thursday evening.
OL,15,FThe road was shut for about six hours
OL,16,Fovernight, reopening at about 01:20
OL,17,FBST, while debris was cleared.
OL,19,FA diversion was put in place.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
